  - speakerName: Gwen (You)
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 736716699, guid: b8f420521dfb8654facb0ce5996feb91, type: 3}
    text: ' <i>Sigh.</i> Thanks for all the help, guys, but I don''t think Claire
